  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Improved default rendering engine.\nFixed issue with TC entries that have tab character on TableOfEntries.Update.\nAdded support for preserving revision's UTC date.\nFixed issue with alt chunk formatting in DOCX reader.\nFixed issue with system color that has luminance transforms in DOCX files.\nFixed issue with duplicate list identifiers in RTF reader.\nFixed issue with collapsed and overlapped rows in PDF writer.\nFixed issue with missing gridlines in DOCX writer.\nAdded support for rendering OleObject that has Group instead of Picture as preview.\nFixed issue with invalid hyperlink address in HTML writer.\nFixed issue with continuous section breaks in PDF writer.\nFixed issue with printing on Windows Server 2025.\nFixed issue with missing line shapes in RTF reader.\nFixed issue with table border clipping in PDF writer.\nFixed issue with indented code blocks inside list items in MD reader.\nAdded support for arabic letters in high-fidelity PDF reader.",
